    "solution": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"uz\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Loyihalar</title>\n    <style>\n        img {\n            max-width: 100%;\n            height: auto;\n        }\n\n        h1 {\n            font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw + 1rem, 3rem);\n        }\n\n        .site-header {\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n        }\n\n        .cards {\n            display: grid;\n            grid-template-columns: 1fr;\n            gap: 16px;\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 600px) {\n            .site-header {\n                flex-direction: row;\n                justify-content: space-between;\n            }\n\n            .cards {\n                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);\n            }\n        }\n\n        @media (min-width: 900px) {\n            .cards {\n                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    <header class=\"site-header\">\n        <p>Veb-dasturlash to‘garagi</p>\n        <nav><a href=\"index.html\">Bosh sahifa</a> <a href=\"join.html\">Yozilish</a></nav>\n    </header>\n    <main>\n        <h1>Ishtirokchilar loyihalari</h1>\n        <div class=\"cards\">\n            <article><img src=\"images/1.jpg\" alt=\"Noutbukdagi portfolio sayti\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\"><h2>Portfolio</h2></article>\n            <article><img src=\"images/2.jpg\" alt=\"Telefondagi kafe menyusi\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\"><h2>Kafe</h2></article>\n            <article><img src=\"images/3.jpg\" alt=\"Kutubxona katalogi\" width=\"800\" height=\"500\"><h2>Kutubxona</h2></article>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n</body>\n</html>",
